{%- comment -%}
  Section Design Mode
  Render contract:
  - section_settings {SettingsDrop, required}: section.settings carrying the
    complete schema contract documented in snippets/design-system-vars.liquid.
  Usage: {% render 'section-design-mode', section_settings: section.settings %}
  Schema fragment for callers: copy the complete SECTION SETTINGS SCHEMA
  CONTRACT from snippets/design-system-vars.liquid without changing IDs,
  options, defaults, or visible_if expressions.
  Schema remains on the rendering section.

  Auto emits nothing so the section inherits the root --ds-* values.
  Blend and Custom emit a scoped set for the complete section subtree.
  
  Blend inherits only the global responsive Design Modes; every Design System
  value the section's schema carries is its own, falling back to the global
  value when left unset. Custom owns the responsive modes as well. The
  Modern/Minimal decision is the only thing that separates the two.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'design-system-vars', source: section_settings %}